# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles run inside Linux containers: force LF.
#
# On Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true these files are otherwise
# written with CRLF, which turns a shebang into "#!/bin/sh\r". exec() then
# looks for an interpreter literally named "/bin/sh\r" and fails with
#   exec /usr/local/bin/cli: no such file or directory
# even though the file is present and executable.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

Dockerfile    text eol=lf
Dockerfile.*  text eol=lf
